OL,3,GNEWSAOil firm fined for breaking
OL,4,Aenvironmental rules hundreds of times
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's largest oil refinery
OL,7,Foperators has been ordered to pay
OL,8,F#873,473 after breaching environmental
OL,9,Fpermit limits nearly 500 times over
OL,10,Fthree years.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said the
OL,13,FStanlow refinery in Ellesmere Port,
OL,14,FCheshire, exceeded wastewater discharge
OL,15,Flimits at least 489 times between 2018
OL,16,Fand 2020. Essar Oil (UK) Limited
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to 12 charges in March.
OL,19,FEssar Oil, which trades as EET Fuels,
OL,20,Fwas fined #800,000 and ordered to pay
OL,21,F#73,473 in costs at Warrington
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
